{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"docs/hosted/video-script.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T11:49:03.373731Z","id":"07107627d2f0b4652c5fb01fb9c958cf18f0e080c7f3094e6a19b18170a8e75c","body":{"detail":"The 'Rust stack differences' section lists, per shot, what `just hosted-demo` (the Worker under wrangler dev --local by default, demo/) shows instead: a seeded fork naming its source but no fork list on the original (shots 1, 2, 9), git in the RepoDO stand-in with a dev-route token and no Clone dialog or Artifacts namespace (2, 10, 11), Reload for an agent's version (3, 5), the agents' drafts over the MCP adapter (3, 4), approvals through People's Always allow and the inbox rather than a four-choice Approvals page (6), the guest naming themselves in the people panel (8).","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":7},"end":{"line":63},"content_hash":"357dcfc290242d2247ba3567f1f2b51b8484f34d092d3533c1b45fa68f2d1a22"},"summary":"The shots are still the TypeScript prototype's: recording on the Rust stack needs them rewritten from the Rust stack differences list","supersedes":"6b8c30e9cefcac89d6a02d7b2c2d17d0ce397e2952f59c013f6d1cb3ae6c47c7","tags":["demo","docs","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
